# "Its controller" is whoever controls the permanent as it is destroyed, not its owner (CR 608.2h): Bot1 takes Bot2's
# Ornithopter with Act of Treason and destroys it with Indomitable Creativity (X = 1, 7 mana for both spells). Bot1 reveals
# from Bot1's library and puts the creature card onto Bot1's battlefield; Bot2, the owner, reveals nothing and loses nothing
# else.

